1
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,640
My lord, why are you still awake so late at night?

2
00:00:35,480 --> 00:00:36,760
The servants reported seeing

3
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,440
a maid wandering the manor late at night

4
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,400
and brought her in for questioning

5
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,720
How has my wife been doing lately?

6
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,600
The princess consort is perfectly well

7
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:52,840
Do you have a lover in this household?

8
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,640
What kind of scheme is Zhu Huaichen up to?

9
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:00,680
My lover is Ah Huang, the kitchen boy

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,520
Wait

11
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:04,960
Why is Huashan acting so strangely today?

12
00:01:05,520 --> 00:01:06,960
Why would she say these things?

13
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:12,040
Then what about the money and deed found on you?

14
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:13,880
How do you explain that?

15
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:18,720
The money and deed were given to me by the princess consort

16
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,600
I can't let him keep questioning her

17
00:01:21,280 --> 00:01:23,520
The princess consort thought my cooking was excellent

18
00:01:23,880 --> 00:01:26,360
so she granted me freedom to open a food stall

19
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:27,920
She even promised to paint for me

20
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:30,000
My lord, this is all my fault

21
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,200
I should have discussed this with you

22
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,440
I privately gave Huashan her deed of servitude

23
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:36,960
I thought she was skilled and young

24
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:39,680
If she could open her own eatery outside

25
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,080
she would surely have a bright future

26
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:43,720
and free her descendants from servitude

27
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:46,520
You wouldn't blame me, would you, my lord?

28
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,760
My wife is so kind-hearted

29
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,840
Of course I wouldn't blame you

30
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:56,920
Huashan

31
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,440
Huashan, you may leave now

32
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,720
Let me explain to my lord

33
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:03,000
My lord has always been exceptionally kind to servants

34
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,560
Surely he wouldn't make things difficult for Huashan

35
00:02:06,240 --> 00:02:08,760
Isn't this the maid the princess usually interacts with?

36
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:29,360
Huashan... Now I remember

37
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,440
The Western Envoy once gave Zhu Huaichen a Truth-Telling Gu

38
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:34,400
They say whoever is infected by this gu

39
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:35,920
must answer any question asked

40
00:02:36,280 --> 00:02:37,360
and must answer truthfully

41
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,920
Zhu Huaichen

42
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,320
You're truly despicable

43
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,240
What is that?

44
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:45,000
Blood

45
00:02:45,920 --> 00:02:47,240
It's the smell of blood

46
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:49,600
Assassins!

47
00:02:50,440 --> 00:02:51,560
Huashan is dead

48
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:54,360
Assassins! My lord, run!

49
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:09,280
Imperial Brother

50
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:13,440
The whereabouts of the Dragon Jade remain unknown

51
00:03:14,160 --> 00:03:16,600
We must stop listening to the slander of villains

52
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,560
To avoid arousing Li Zhi'an's suspicion

53
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:21,080
It wasn't his idea

54
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:23,360
All because of you

55
00:03:24,520 --> 00:03:25,800
But now it's fine

56
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:29,560
Tested the gu worms - they're indeed effective

57
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,400
Once the old Li faction surrenders

58
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:35,120
Obtaining the Dragon Jade will be as easy as taking something from a bag

59
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:38,840
You won't have to

60
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,520
Be a substitute anymore

61
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,160
Zhi'an

62
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:52,840
Zhi'an, wake up

63
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,600
Zhi'an... Zhi'an...

64
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,840
Huashan

65
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,160
Huashan

66
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:39,640
Zhu Huaichen is ruthless, treating human lives as worthless as grass

67
00:04:39,640 --> 00:04:41,120
He's becoming increasingly deranged

68
00:04:41,720 --> 00:04:43,640
I must quickly contact the remaining members of the Li family

69
00:04:46,080 --> 00:04:46,920
Imperial Consort

70
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:50,320
The Grand Princess has gone to Nanshan for spiritual cultivation

71
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:53,080
That Nanshan is located at the border between Nanliang and Beijin

72
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,600
It's a long journey

73
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:58,240
I'm afraid this token won't reach her hands

74
00:04:59,440 --> 00:05:03,200
It seems I won't be able to meet her anytime soon

75
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:06,760
What about Hualan?

76
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,200
Hualan has already taken her certificate of freedom and returned home

77
00:05:10,200 --> 00:05:12,600
She took Huashan's remains with her

78
00:05:16,280 --> 00:05:17,120
It's good that she left

79
00:05:22,760 --> 00:05:24,400
Li Zhi'an is clearly so suspicious

80
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,280
Why hasn't the Seventh Prince taken action against her yet?

81
00:05:27,840 --> 00:05:31,880
And he keeps compromising his plans for her repeatedly

82
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,800
Even though he's been planning for so long

83
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:35,360
Isn't it obvious?

84
00:05:35,560 --> 00:05:37,560
He's not doing it because he doesn't want to

85
00:05:38,840 --> 00:05:39,960
The Seventh Prince

86
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,600
has feelings for Li Zhi'an

87
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:48,280
I won't let anyone interfere with his ascension to the throne

88
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:52,480
You'd better not make any unnecessary moves

89
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,800
The Seventh Prince has his own plans

90
00:06:16,520 --> 00:06:17,600
Li Zhi'an

91
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:19,760
Let's see how you'll manage

92
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:22,040
to escape this Truth Worm nourished with my blood

93
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:25,680
Once you swallow this worm

94
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,400
you won't be able to hide the whereabouts of the Dragon Jade Treasure

95
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:31,360
Once we obtain the treasure

96
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:35,080
you'll become expendable

97
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,600
Steward Duan dismissed the servants

98
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,440
Do you wish to discuss something with me?

99
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:56,160
This is the newly bestowed Yangchun wine from His Majesty this year

100
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:59,320
I brought it especially for the Princess Consort to taste

101
00:07:01,400 --> 00:07:04,000
Now that she's under Zhu Huaijin's command

102
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,920
Could it be Zhu Huaijin sent her to plant a worm in me?

103
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,360
The Princess Consort has impaired vision

104
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,600
Let me assist you

105
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:24,360
Steward Duan, why does this wine smell foul?

106
00:07:24,880 --> 00:07:27,280
Has something unclean contaminated it?

107
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,360
Let me get you another cup

108
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,880
This is newly poured wine

109
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,160
It definitely shouldn't smell foul

110
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:42,400
If you still refuse to drink this imperial wine

111
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:44,200
I'll begin to suspect

112
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,880
it's not your sense of smell that's the problem

113
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:50,720
but something else entirely
